{"id": "EUVD-2026-98940", "enisaUuid": "f1b32213-a67f-363a-8788-915551b22e4f", "description": "RuoYi-Cloud-Plus through 6.0.0 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows authenticated users to delete other users' social login bindings by supplying their socialId. Attackers can send DELETE /auth/unlock/{socialId}, which deletes sys_social rows by primary key without ownership checks, removing victims' OAuth tokens and blocking social login.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:09", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:45:13", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/ruoyi-cloud-plus-social-unbind-idor", "https://github.com/dromara/RuoYi-Cloud-Plus/blob/27a79a10e25b120aa33799d0dd4c720d1c8cf631/ruoyi-auth/src/main/java/org/dromara/auth/controller/TokenController.java#L149-L153", "https://github.com/dromara/RuoYi-Cloud-Plus/blob/27a79a10e25b120aa33799d0dd4c720d1c8cf631/ruoyi-modules/ruoyi-system/src/main/java/org/dromara/system/service/impl/SysSocialServiceImpl.java#L111-L113", "https://github.com/dromara/RuoYi-Cloud-Plus", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/ruoyi-cloud-plus-through-6.0.0-idor-via-delete-auth-unlock-socialid"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110107", "GHSA-qfpm-hv5j-w5q6"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "701cec08-af92-3dce-8a5d-ce8639f1014b", "product": {"name": "RuoYi-Cloud-Plus", "vendor": {"name": "dromara"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22646.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b69e9aa8-28dd-3006-a108-f9424c2c964e", "vendor": {"name": "dromara"}}], "isExploited": false}